§§ `27 February 2024: the text changed at 9.30 a.m. (R&O.10/2024); a day cannot be asked, an instant can`

-- By date alone the favoured reading of F7.1 refuses: the Minister at 08:00 is the Chief Minister and at 10:00 the Minister for External Relations, so no answer holds for the day.
#ASSERT REFUSED `Int (e) the text of the Law in force on` fleet (YMD 2024 2 27)
